    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the aftermath of a treacherous rebellion, Phaedon of Arsica is imprisoned and left for dead. Freed by a twist of fate, he now hunts down those who betrayed him and his homeland. But time is running out, Phaedon must stop his former comrades before they complete their misbegotten quest to reclaim an ancient power source.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Key Features</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DIMENSION-BENDING TRAVERSAL:\u00a0</strong>Every stage in Revenant\u2019s Reach is a complete 3D environment, wrapped in a planar movement spline that allows the player to navigate each stage with a higher degree of immersion than a normal 2D platformer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692780/extras/23afbd1ddd1acd41466676f74b6114c2.poster.avif?t=1746650628\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692780/extras/23afbd1ddd1acd41466676f74b6114c2.webm?t=1746650628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692780/extras/23afbd1ddd1acd41466676f74b6114c2.mp4?t=1746650628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DYNAMIC COMBAT:\u00a0</strong>Master the Crescata Arts to take down foes with lethal grace. Dash, deflect, retaliate, and eviscerate those who stand in your way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692780/extras/e4de56821ab93a69fe9ddc880efb13d4.poster.avif?t=1746650628\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692780/extras/e4de56821ab93a69fe9ddc880efb13d4.webm?t=1746650628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692780/extras/e4de56821ab93a69fe9ddc880efb13d4.mp4?t=1746650628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GRAPPLER MECHANICS:\u00a0</strong>Tether, swing and slingstrike your way to vengeance with a grappler mechanic that is both thrilling and responsive.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692780/extras/1a879aa1e436a39241b70fb39bb74d29.poster.avif?t=1746650628\" width=600 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692780/extras/1a879aa1e436a39241b70fb39bb74d29.webm?t=1746650628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692780/extras/1a879aa1e436a39241b70fb39bb74d29.mp4?t=1746650628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BRUTAL BOSS FIGHTS: </strong>Unleash Phaedon's wrath in demanding Boss Encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692780/extras/6f0a69a48de50a827c1401a8e0ce5e7c.poster.avif?t=1746650628\" width=600 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692780/extras/6f0a69a48de50a827c1401a8e0ce5e7c.webm?t=1746650628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692780/extras/6f0a69a48de50a827c1401a8e0ce5e7c.mp4?t=1746650628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CRESCATA ARMAMENTS:</strong>\u00a0Regain Phaedon's stolen Crescata Armaments, and discover hidden gems to slot into his Crescent Claw. Further enhancing his lethality and tactical abilities.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the aftermath of a treacherous rebellion, Phaedon of Arsica is imprisoned and left for dead. Freed by a twist of fate, he now hunts down those who betrayed him and his homeland. But time is running out, Phaedon must stop his former comrades before they complete their misbegotten quest to reclaim an ancient power source.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Key Features</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DIMENSION-BENDING TRAVERSAL:\u00a0</strong>Every stage in Revenant\u2019s Reach is a complete 3D environment, wrapped in a planar movement spline that allows the player to navigate each stage with a higher degree of immersion than a normal 2D platformer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692780/extras/23afbd1ddd1acd41466676f74b6114c2.poster.avif?t=1746650628\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692780/extras/23afbd1ddd1acd41466676f74b6114c2.webm?t=1746650628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692780/extras/23afbd1ddd1acd41466676f74b6114c2.mp4?t=1746650628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DYNAMIC COMBAT:\u00a0</strong>Master the Crescata Arts to take down foes with lethal grace. Dash, deflect, retaliate, and eviscerate those who stand in your way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692780/extras/e4de56821ab93a69fe9ddc880efb13d4.poster.avif?t=1746650628\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692780/extras/e4de56821ab93a69fe9ddc880efb13d4.webm?t=1746650628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692780/extras/e4de56821ab93a69fe9ddc880efb13d4.mp4?t=1746650628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GRAPPLER MECHANICS:\u00a0</strong>Tether, swing and slingstrike your way to vengeance with a grappler mechanic that is both thrilling and responsive.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692780/extras/1a879aa1e436a39241b70fb39bb74d29.poster.avif?t=1746650628\" width=600 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692780/extras/1a879aa1e436a39241b70fb39bb74d29.webm?t=1746650628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692780/extras/1a879aa1e436a39241b70fb39bb74d29.mp4?t=1746650628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BRUTAL BOSS FIGHTS: </strong>Unleash Phaedon's wrath in demanding Boss Encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692780/extras/6f0a69a48de50a827c1401a8e0ce5e7c.poster.avif?t=1746650628\" width=600 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692780/extras/6f0a69a48de50a827c1401a8e0ce5e7c.webm?t=1746650628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692780/extras/6f0a69a48de50a827c1401a8e0ce5e7c.mp4?t=1746650628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CRESCATA ARMAMENTS:</strong>\u00a0Regain Phaedon's stolen Crescata Armaments, and discover hidden gems to slot into his Crescent Claw. Further enhancing his lethality and tactical abilities.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Revenant\u2019s Reach is a 2.5D side-scrolling action platformer that combines dynamic, fast-paced combat with versatile grappler mechanics. Guide the relentless Phaedon of Arsica on his quest for vengeance as he hunts down those who betrayed and left him for dead.",
